{"_id":"ZAnb2bR9XZkIomS2","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/npc-gallery/barkeep.webp","items":[{"_id":"JRdrmOGWMBFJengY","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.TLQErnOpM9Luy7rL"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/sap.webp","name":"Sap","sort":100000,"system":{"baseItem":"sap","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"martial","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":1,"die":"d6"},"description":{"value":"<p>A sap has a soft wrapping around a dense core, typically a leather sheath around a lead rod. Its head is wider than its grip to disperse the force of a blow, as the weapon's purpose is to knock out its victim rather than to draw blood.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":1,"invested":null},"expend":null,"group":"club","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"sp":1}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"range":null,"reload":{"value":null},"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"sap","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["agile","nonlethal"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ZAnb2bR9XZkIomS2.JRdrmOGWMBFJengY"},{"_id":"HuqsExeC8DG7dt5Z","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.zBYEU9E7034ENCmh"},"img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-banded-leather-brown.webp","name":"Barkeep's Apron","sort":200000,"system":{"acBonus":1,"baseItem":"padded-armor","bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"light","checkPenalty":0,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This armor is simply a layer of heavy, quilted cloth, but it is sometimes used because it's so inexpensive. Padded armor is easier to damage and destroy than other types of armor. Heavy armor comes with a padded armor undercoat included in its Price, though it loses the comfort trait when worn under heavy armor. You can wear just that padded armor or undercoat to sleep in, if your heavy armor is destroyed, or when otherwise not wearing the full heavy armor. This allows you to keep the armor invested and benefit from the power of any runes on the associated heavy armor, but no one else can wear your heavy armor without the padded undercoat.</p>"},"dexCap":3,"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","inSlot":true,"invested":null},"group":null,"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"sp":2}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"size":"med","slug":"padded-armor","speedPenalty":0,"strength":0,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["comfort"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"armor","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ZAnb2bR9XZkIomS2.HuqsExeC8DG7dt5Z"},{"_id":"JtEtXdQY26QW7Yh7","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.wRSS5vP8ltrThsoC"},"img":"icons/containers/kitchenware/mug-steel-wood-brown.webp","name":"Pewter Mug","sort":300000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":""},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":1,"invested":null},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"cp":1}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"mug","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"equipment","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!ZAnb2bR9XZkIomS2.JtEtXdQY26QW7Yh7"},{"_id":"un2PSYOK7aGBLat2","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.UMAXLDpI6YLSfYX1"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/alchemical-items/drugs/alcohol.webp","name":"Flask of Whiskey","sort":400000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"other","containerId":null,"damage":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Alcohol is a common substance available in stunning variety. The Price of a dose of alcohol depends on the specific beverage. You can't recover from the sickened condition from alcohol while affected.</p>\n<p>If you fail a saving throw against alcohol other than initial saves, the affliction's stage doesn't increase; the only way to increase the stage of alcohol's affliction is to consume more alcohol.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact (Ingested)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:12|name:Alcohol]</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard}, +1 item bonus to saving throws against fear effects (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, off-guard, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> clumsy 2 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> clumsy 2, sickened 2, and stupefied 2 (10 minutes)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 6</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} (8 hours)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 7</strong> death</p>"},"eq